---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About XP Robotics.">
	<h1 class="post-title" style="margin-bottom:40px">About</h1>
	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			XP Robotics builds the data and learning stack for general-purpose robots. We collect egocentric video of
			people doing everyday tasks, turn it into robot-ready training data, and use it to teach robots new skills.
		</p>
		<p>
			This blog is where we write up what we learn along the way: data collection, hand tracking, retargeting,
			and robot learning.
		</p>
		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			Find us on <a href="https://github.com/XP-Robotics">GitHub</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>
